sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor STW as Data Protection Steward
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as AttributeKeysController
    participant S as AttributeKeyService
    participant E as IDataEncryptor
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    Note over W,DB: Encryption:MasterKeys has versions 1 and 2, Encryption:CurrentVersion = 2 (server configuration)
    STW->>W: Click "Rewrap keys"
    W->>C: PUT /api/AttributeKeys/rewrap
    C->>S: RewrapAsync()
    S->>R: Load active keys with masterKeyVersion < current
    loop each key
        S->>E: Unwrap with the old version, wrap with the current version (HKDF bound to the key row)
        S->>R: PrepareUpdate wrappedKey, masterKeyVersion
    end
    S->>R: SaveAsync()
    R->>DB: UPDATE ATTRIBUTEKEYS
    S->>S: Log activity attributeKeysRewrapped
    S-->>C: RewrapAttributeKeyResponse (count)
    C-->>W: 200 OK
